Z||000000||mafv8||08-26-2001||11:14 AM||||I recently bought a V8 fiero from Jeff Lorenz down in Illinois, it currently has a pod tach fitted. The cluster had been cut up to include some other guages, so I got another cluster on E-bay, which also had the 120mph speedo, and wanted to convert the tach to read the V8. I understand I need to change a capacitor to a 0.0064uF value, the only capacitor I can find is marked R47uF, 15v, is that the correct one ? I did see some previous messages and purchased some 6800PF 50V capacitors from Radio Shack, so can any one tell me if I am on the right track, Thanks<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
