Z||000011||fieroluke||08-30-2001||12:15 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by LS1swap:<BR>[B]I can't seem to get the link to work here is the info  [URL=Http://64.4.16.250/cgi-bin/linkrd?_lang=EN&lah=98a86f5fa6405a43e9fa838b07bea55b&lat=999069772&hm___action=http%3a%2f%2fbusiness%2efortunecity%2ecom%2ftakeover%2f175%2findex%2e html]Http://64.4.16.250/cgi-bin/linkrd?_lang=EN&lah=98a86f5fa6405a43e9fa838b07bea55b&lat=999069772&hm___action=http%3a%2f%2fbusiness%2efortunecity%2ecom%2ftakeover%2f175%2findex%2e html[/URL] <P>Yes, my site has moved, I'm now at:<P>http:/www.fieros.de<P>Which should be easier to remember. Mind the "S" at the end though, it FIEROS not FIERO <P>Take care,<P>-Oliver (currently in Toronto)<P>------------------<BR>Visit my website: <A HREF="http://www.fieros.de" TARGET=_blank>www.fieros.de</A>  for lots of technical and other Fiero related information<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fieros.de/jpg/mycars.jpg"> ||||reg||4
